  "prefLabel": "Fis 1502.06 Legal Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1502.06 Legal Address. Whenever a registrant is required to furnish his or her address by statute or rule, the address shall reflect a street, road, avenue, or like designation. A post office or rural route box number, without more, shall not be adequate.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18",
